      "schema:comment": "From the ELN (Chemotion LCJ-R5, LCJ-R8): the starting material samples 'Spruce Wood — RCF Feed' (LCJ-35-1, 'aliquot from SPRUCE-2025-03 stock') and 'Spruce Wood Pellets — Raw Biomass' (LCJ-159, 'Air-dried, knife-milled Picea abies' in its parent LCJ-28), samples without a structure. The batches are not library entries.",
