      "schema:comment": "Added by curation; not in the ELN as a substance: the Chemotion records LCJ-R5 and LCJ-R8 speak of a 'lignin-derived liquid product' and 'G-unit depolymerisation' of spruce wood - the lignin of the wood is the substrate of the RCF (suggested by Claude Code, confirmed by Laura Fadler on 05.10.2026 for the Chemotion example).",
